OL,3,GNEWSAHiker died in 100ft fall while on
OL,4,AWales' highest mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn experienced hiker died after losing
OL,7,Fhis footing and falling 100ft from a
OL,8,Fridge on Yr Wyddfa.
OL,10,FAdrian McAnarney, 57, from County Down
OL,11,Fin Northern Ireland, had travelled with
OL,12,Fa group to Holyhead, to climb the
OL,13,Fmountain and go sightseeing.
OL,15,FAn inquest in Caernarfon, Gwynedd, on
OL,16,FWednesday heard the carpenter fell from
OL,17,FCrib Goch, and died from multiple crush
OL,18,Finjuries on 2 August.
OL,20,FCrib Goch is a narrow ridge which
OL,21,Foffers a route up Yr Wyddfa, Wales'
OL,22,Fhighest peak.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
